    "HelpText": [
      "Help1",
      "This software is for Chromaticity Coordinates calculation, which contains CIE1931 2 degree field of view.\r\n\r\n1.The left Data Input textbox is to acquire the spectra power distribution. The data format is as follows:\r\n  Wavelength List_Separator Power_Data\r\n  which the list separator can be space, comma or Tab, and double click the Data Input label can import data file.\r\n2.Select the data format:\r\n  1)1nm per data point\r\n  2)5nm per data point\r\n  default option is the first data format.\r\n3.Calculate\r\n  It can calculate the CIE 1931 chromaticity coordinates (x, y), tristimulus value X,Y,Z, and uniform chromaticity scale 1976 (u',v').\r\n4.Draw Point\r\n  Draw the calculated chromaticity coordiantes on the CIE 1931 chromaticity diagram.\r\n5.Export Graph\r\n  Export the CIE 1931 chromaticity diagram with points marked on as image files.\r\n\r\nDesigned by nicklxg 2009\r\nE-mail: nicklxg@163.com\r\nVersion: 1.6.0.2",
      "This software is for Chromaticity Coordinates calculation, which contains CIE1931 2 degree field of view.\r\n\r\n1.The left Data Input textbox is to acquire the spectra power distribution. The data format is as follows:\r\n  Wavelength List_Separator Power_Data\r\n  which the list separator can be space, comma or Tab, and double click the Data Input label can import data file.\r\n2.Select the data format:\r\n  1)1nm per data point\r\n  2)5nm per data point\r\n  default option is the first data format.\r\n3.Calculate\r\n  It can calculate the CIE 1931 chromaticity coordinates (x, y), tristimulus value X,Y,Z, and uniform chromaticity scale 1976 (u',v').\r\n4.Draw Point\r\n  Draw the calculated chromaticity coordiantes on the CIE 1931 chromaticity diagram.\r\n5.Export Graph\r\n  Export the CIE 1931 chromaticity diagram with points marked on as image files.\r\n\r\nDesigned by nicklxg 2009\r\nE-mail: nicklxg@163.com\r\nVersion: 1.6.0.2",
      "本软件是关于色坐标的计算,包含了CIE1931的2度视场XYZ色度系统\r\n\r\n1.左边的数据输入框用于接受光谱功率分布数据,数据格式如下:\r\n  波长 数据分隔符 光谱功率数据\r\n  其中,数据分隔符可以是空格,逗号或Tab，双击数据输入标签可导入数据文件。\r\n2.选择一种数据格式:\r\n  1)每1nm一个数据\r\n  2)每5nm一个数据\r\n  默认为第1项。\r\n3.计算\r\n  可计算CIE1931色坐标(x,y),三刺激值X,Y,Z和均匀色空间1976(u',v')。\r\n4.描绘坐标\r\n  根据色坐标的计算结果在CIE1931xy色度图上标出。\r\n5.导出图片\r\n  将CIE1931xy色度图上描绘的坐标作为图片导出。\r\n\r\nDesigned by nicklxg 2009\r\nE-mail: nicklxg@163.com\r\nVersion: 1.6.0.2"
    ]
